paragraph.content:
by amending subparagraph (C) of paragraph (2) by deleting the word “or” in clause (ii); by deleting the period at the end of clause (iii) and inserting “; or”; and by adding a new clause (iv) as follows:

                    “(iv) designated as a noxious liquid substance under Annex II of the Protocol of 1978 Relating to the International Convention for the Prevention of Pollution from Ships, 1973.”
                ;
